# Packages published to the beta suite of https://apt.skymob.app — the canary
# channel. Sites opt in by adding `beta` to Suites: in their skymob.sources;
# everyone else never sees what is listed here.
#
# apt installs the highest version across the suites a site subscribes to, so a
# version listed here reaches canaries and nothing else. When it has soaked,
# Move-AptPromotion carries it over to stable.list and takes it off this file —
# canaries keep receiving it from stable, so leaving it on both would only pin a
# second copy in the pool.
#
# This file is allowed to be empty, and normally is: between candidates there is
# nothing to try out, canaries fall through to stable, and apt reads an empty
# suite without complaint.
#
# Edit it with New-AptPromotion -Channel beta / Move-AptPromotion /
# Remove-AptPromotion -Channel beta (Promote.psm1), not by hand: the matching
# .deb files under pool/ have to move with it, and the publish workflow refuses
# a commit where the manifests and the pool disagree.
#
# Format is stable.list's: "<package> <version>", one per line.

skbridge 0.1.41
skprinter 0.1.5
